{"title":"1994 AHSME Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A large rectangle is partitioned into four rectangles by two segments parallel to its sides. The areas of three of the resulting rectangles are shown. What is the area of the fourth rectangle?\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/f/31f1dc6fc961ef17ec97066f3f86050dca58b393.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((0,0)--(10,0)--(10,7)--(0,7)--cycle); draw((0,5)--(10,5)); draw((3,0)--(3,7)); label(&quot;6&quot;, (1.5,6)); label(&quot;?&quot;, (1.5,2.5)); label(&quot;14&quot;, (6.5,6)); label(&quot;35&quot;, (6.5,2.5)); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"178\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/f/e7f07f8d626c2bf540a2f685cfe05f8769f3d5d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 10 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 15 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 20 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 21 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"394\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/1/9b1be94397c1f8fdf513d00d24423fdae84c4bb8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] pair A=(0,0),B=(10,0),C=(10,7),D=(0,7),EE=(0,5),F=(10,5),G=(3,0),H=(3,7); path BG=shift(0,-0.5)*(B--G); path BF=shift(0.5,0)*(B--F); path FC=shift(0.5,0)*(F--C); path DH=shift(0,0.5)*(D--H); draw(A--B--C--D--cycle); draw(EE--F); draw(G--H); draw(BG,L=Label(&quot;$7$&quot;,position=MidPoint,align=(0,-1)),arrow=Arrows(),bar=Bars,red); draw(BF,L=Label(&quot;$5$&quot;,position=MidPoint,align=(1,0)),arrow=Arrows(),bar=Bars,red); draw(FC,L=Label(&quot;$2$&quot;,position=MidPoint,align=(1,0)),arrow=Arrows(),bar=Bars,red); draw(DH,L=Label(&quot;$3$&quot;,position=MidPoint,align=(0,1)),arrow=Arrows(),bar=Bars,red); label(&quot;$6$&quot;, (1.5,6)); label(&quot;$15$&quot;, (1.5,2.5),blue); label(&quot;$14$&quot;, (6.5,6)); label(&quot;$35$&quot;, (6.5,2.5)); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"222\" />\n</p><p>We can easily see the dimensions of each small rectangle. So the area of the last rectangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/5/485df76a7affc3aaf29d0ae7dbb21df205414638.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3\\times 5=\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>--Solution by <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=200685\">TheMaskedMagician</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/8/9982a8f60a563a78e0f60ee91aabfe795ab4c96c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] pair A=(0,0),B=(10,0),C=(10,7),D=(0,7),EE=(0,5),F=(10,5),G=(3,0),H=(3,7); path CH=C--H; path BF=B--F; path FC=F--C; path DH=D--H; draw(A--B--C--D--cycle); draw(EE--F); draw(G--H); draw(CH,L=Label(&quot;$b$&quot;,position=MidPoint,align=(0,1))); draw(BF,L=Label(&quot;$y$&quot;,position=MidPoint,align=(1,0))); draw(FC,L=Label(&quot;$x$&quot;,position=MidPoint,align=(1,0))); draw(DH,L=Label(&quot;$a$&quot;,position=MidPoint,align=(0,1))); label(&quot;$6$&quot;, (1.5,6)); label(&quot;$14$&quot;, (6.5,6)); label(&quot;$35$&quot;, (6.5,2.5)); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"185\" />\n</p><p>In case its not immediately obvious from inspection what the dimensions of the small rectangles are, we can work it out.  We know <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/a/16ac88dd5af044d10a9c0e3fddbbe05f95c9a91d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ax$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"22\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/3/473630c2e90f9f51fb86de9d40a1a2a5b436a608.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$bx$\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/d/9ed8bd877353f4f9c1305efbcbebcea0ec506f74.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$by$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"17\" height=\"16\" /> and we want to know <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/3/493505f8f7259a8543a0873d2ce1f9d78f153f68.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ay$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"18\" height=\"11\" />.   We can compute it as follows <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/b/35b5f871a966b029a689f0af2e8a77fcf1014a2a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ay = \\frac{(ax)(by)}{bx} = \\frac{ 6\\cdot 35 }{14} = 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"223\" height=\"39\" /> and the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/c/13c3218ca790f4eac4048f34f68433655b19e1f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME\" title=\"1994 AHSME\">1994 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1994 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1994 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1994\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1994 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1994 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>